WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,270
Even the rescue forces can't take care of it.

2
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:08,270
We can only count on civilian teams

3
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,700
I am not strong enough alone

4
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,700
How is it

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:23,790
Would you like to go there?

6
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:27,840
Can I go too?

7
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,840
are you sure

8
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,340
That's when it really comes

9
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,840
I may not care about you

10
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:36,280
I don’t need your protection today, right?

11
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:40,020
If you want to follow, just follow. Okay.

12
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,020
Then eat slowly

13
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,020
In fact, I also want to act alone

14
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,520
Always stay with them

15
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,020
Inconvenient to collect supplies

16
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,520
Listen to the meaning behind Sister Wang’s words

17
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,020
I’m afraid the future is not optimistic.

18
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,020
Have to prepare early

19
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,020
You need to hoard supplies and practice skills.

20
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,020
It's too weak. No matter how much you hoard, you can't defend it.

21
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,020
Let’s get over fear first
